{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pro Soccer Online is a 1st/3rd person, highly skill based, online multiplayer soccer game. It offers a sports game experience unlike any other with smooth, physics based, input driven gameplay that is competitive and rewarding with no pay to win mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What makes Pro Soccer Online so good?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1) Input Driven Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay in Pro Soccer Online is completely input driven, not animation driven like many other sports games. Your decisions and skills on the field are the only thing that matter in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2) Dedicated servers</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pro Soccer Online has dedicated servers in NA (Ohio), SA (Sao Paulo), EU  (Milan), and AS (Seoul), and AU (Sydney).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3) Custom Lobbies</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom lobbies are available to all players so you can setup a match to be just how you like it. It's great for hosting private matches and offers more options than matchmaking. There is overtime, single keeper mode, team sizes from 3v3 all the way up to a full size match of 11v11. <br><strong>4) Player customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your player in different ways like choosing your hair and facial hair style, hair and facial hair color, make your own custom shoe design, choose different shirt styles, gloves wristbands, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5) No pay to win mechanics</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pro Soccer Online aims to be the most competitive and satisfying sports gaming experience there is. Having pay to win would completely ruin that. There are no pay to win mechanics in Pro Soccer Online.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1st Match","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"All I do is Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"GOOOOAAALLL!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"Hat Trick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"Helping Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"Teamwork Makes the Dream Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"Defensive Mindset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"},{"name":"Brick Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1583320/9528b4dbae615ea471bb144c251315233850d57f.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1583320?t=1748124441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1583320?t=1748124441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1583320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748124441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1583320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748124441","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pro Soccer Online is a 1st/3rd person, highly skill based, online multiplayer soccer game. It offers a sports game experience unlike any other with smooth, physics based, input driven gameplay that is competitive and rewarding with no pay to win mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What makes Pro Soccer Online so good?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1) Input Driven Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay in Pro Soccer Online is completely input driven, not animation driven like many other sports games. Your decisions and skills on the field are the only thing that matter in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2) Dedicated servers</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pro Soccer Online has dedicated servers in NA (Ohio), SA (Sao Paulo), EU  (Milan), and AS (Seoul), and AU (Sydney).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3) Custom Lobbies</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom lobbies are available to all players so you can setup a match to be just how you like it. It's great for hosting private matches and offers more options than matchmaking. There is overtime, single keeper mode, team sizes from 3v3 all the way up to a full size match of 11v11. <br><strong>4) Player customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your player in different ways like choosing your hair and facial hair style, hair and facial hair color, make your own custom shoe design, choose different shirt styles, gloves wristbands, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5) No pay to win mechanics</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pro Soccer Online aims to be the most competitive and satisfying sports gaming experience there is. Having pay to win would completely ruin that. There are no pay to win mechanics in Pro Soccer Online.</p>","developers":["Skywall Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1583320/header.jpg?t=1748124441","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"mi